OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe railway between Lewes and Haywards
OL,8,FHeath will remain closed for at least
OL,9,Fanother 10 days while teams recover
OL,10,Fthe derailed train and begin repairs
OL,11,Fto the railway.
OL,13,FSouthern Rail and Network Rail are
OL,14,Furging customers travelling next week,
OL,15,Fand in the weeks ahead to check before
OL,16,Fthey travel and, where possible, use
OL,17,Falternative train services via
OL,18,FBrighton.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
