OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FRail replacement buses will run
OL,8,Fbetween Lewes and Haywards Heath,
OL,9,Fserving Cooksbridge and Plumpton.
OL,11,FThese buses have limited capacity, so
OL,12,Fcustomers travelling to other stations
OL,13,Fshould travel via Brighton instead.
OL,15,FThe closure follows the derailment of
OL,16,Fa Southern train near Lewes on
OL,17,FThursday 13 August.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe Rail Accident and Investigation
OL,8,FBranch (RAIB) completed its work on
OL,9,Fsite on Saturday and has now handed
OL,10,Fthe site back to Network Rail.
OL,12,FRAIB's investigation into the
OL,13,Fderailment continues.
OL,15,FA complex recovery operation is now
OL,16,Funder way.
OL,18,FThree carriages derailed and slid part-
OL,19,Fway down the embankment. These will
OL,20,Fneed to be carefully lifted away by
OL,21,Fcrane.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe location makes this particularly
OL,8,Fdifficult.
OL,10,FThe railway is close to a river, in a
OL,11,FSite of Special Scientific Interest,
OL,12,Fand restricted road access is only via
OL,13,Fa residential area.
OL,15,FEngineers are now preparing the site
OL,16,Ffor two 125-tonne rail-mounted cranes,
OL,17,Famong the largest cranes available for
OL,18,Fuse on the railway.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FBefore lifting can begin, teams must
OL,8,Fmake sure the ground and railway are
OL,9,Fstable and strong enough to safely
OL,10,Fsupport the cranes and the weight of
OL,11,Fthe carriages.
OL,13,FOnce the train has been removed,
OL,14,Fengineers will be able to fully assess
OL,15,Fthe damage to the railway and
OL,16,Funderstand the scale of the repair
OL,17,Fwork needed before services can resume
OL,18,Fsafely.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe railway is working with Lewes
OL,8,FDistrict Council and other partners
OL,9,Fthroughout the recovery.
OL,11,FThis work is taking place near to
OL,12,Fhomes and wildlife, and the team is
OL,13,Fengaging closely with the local
OL,14,Fcommunity as this sensitive work takes
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
