OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FJohn Whitehurst, Chief Executive
OL,8,FOfficer of Greater Thameslink Railway
OL,9,F(GTR), which operates Southern
OL,10,FRailway, said: "It has been an
OL,11,Fincredibly difficult time for our
OL,12,Fcustomers and colleagues, and our
OL,13,Fthoughts remain with everyone affected
OL,14,Fby this, particularly the family and
OL,15,Ffriends of those who have been injured.
OL,26,@rD@POU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"We recognise the impact this incident
OL,8,Fwill have on customers' journeys in
OL,9,Fthe days ahead, and we're working
OL,10,Fclosely with Network Rail to do
OL,11,Feverything we can to keep people
OL,12,Fmoving while recovery work continues
OL,13,Fand the railway is restored safely.
OL,15,F"We know this recovery effort is not
OL,16,Fonly affecting rail customers, but
OL,17,Falso local communities around Lewes,
OL,18,Fand I'd like to thank them for their
OL,19,Fpatience and understanding while our
OL,20,Fteams work to restore the railway.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"We're providing replacement transport
OL,8,Fwhere needed and deploying additional
OL,9,Fcolleagues at stations to support
OL,10,Fcustomers and help them complete their
OL,11,Fjourneys.
OL,13,F"I thank customers for their patience
OL,14,Fand understanding while the railway
OL,15,Frecovers from this incident."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FLucy McAuliffe, Network Rail's Sussex
OL,8,FRoute Director, said: "This is a
OL,9,Fcomplex recovery operation in a very
OL,10,Fdifficult location, and our teams are
OL,11,Fworking hard to recover the carriages
OL,12,Fand repair the railway, to resume
OL,13,Fservices safely as soon as we can.
OL,15,F"We know the closure is disruptive and
OL,16,Fthe recovery work also affects people
OL,17,Fliving close to the railway.
OL,26,@pD@WOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786898895
OL,3,CRailway line to remain closed for at
OL,4,Cleast another ten days following
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"I'm grateful for the support and
OL,8,Funderstanding of the local community
OL,9,Fwhile we carry out this work, and for
OL,10,Fthe patience of our customers during
OL,11,Fthis time.
OL,13,F"We are working around the clock to
OL,14,Fget this done."
OL,26,@vD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/11
